#: contents/ui/components/weathermap/HelpPanel.qml:145
msgid "The colored layers share the map, one at a time: temperature, pressure, humidity, dew point, air quality. The column lists the layers as they are stacked on the map, the top one first; the order is set with the button left of the settings. The wind always goes over the others."
msgstr ""

#: contents/ui/config/configAppearance.qml:929
msgid "The condition icon will automatically reflect the current weather using your KDE system icon theme. No customisation is needed."
msgstr "Ikona podmínek bude automaticky reflektovat aktuální počasí pomocí systémového motivu ikon KDE. Není potřeba žádné nastavení."

#: contents/ui/config/tabs/ConfigWidgetTab.qml:238
